      "writtenOn": "2024-05-14T23:02:16Z",
      "side": 0,
      "message": "My understanding of https://b.corp.google.com/issues/295311875#comment14 is this check limits the scope of the global override function to only the updatable modules.\n\nSince we now support per module overrides, module authors have the flexibility (and the responsibility) to set an explicit `min_sdk_version` in only the updatable modules.\n\nI think for consistency with how overrides of other properties work, I would like to remove this special case. WDYT?",
      "parentUuid": "eee33795_a083853f",
      "revId": "d153e008c663e21425921e748cc04f6919cf4ec0",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
